    <title>Integrating cubed trig functions</title>
    <link>https://quartz.jzhao.xyz/topics/integrating-cubed-trig-functions</link>
    <guid>https://quartz.jzhao.xyz/topics/integrating-cubed-trig-functions</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ \begin{aligned} &amp;\int \sin^3 x \text{ d}x\\ =&amp;\int \sin x (1 - \cos^2 x) \text{ d}x\\ =&amp;\int \sin x - \sin x \cos^2 x \text{ d}x\\ =&amp;\int \sin x + (-\sin x) \cos^2 x \text{ d}x\\ =&amp;\ -\cos x + \dfrac{1}{3}\cos^3 x + c \end{aligned} \begin{aligned} &amp;\int \cos^3 x \text{ d}x\\ ... ]]></description>
